      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Dr. Garcia graduated from the University of Medical Sciences of Pinar del Río in 2005.Since her graduation she has practiced medicine as a Primary Care Physician in various countries including Pakistan, Bolivia and Venezuela.In 2018, after having met all the requirements of the state of Florida, she began to practice as a Primary Care Physician at Tampa Bay Family Clinic."
